            ("What imaginary line of latitude circling the Earth at 0 degrees divides the Northern and Southern Hemispheres?", "The Equator", ["The Tropic of Cancer", "The Tropic of Capricorn", "The Prime Meridian"], "The Equator measures approximately 24,901 miles (40,075 km) in circumference."),
